FlexSearch Alembic migrations.

- Fresh databases: tables are created on app startup via `init_db()` in `app/db/postgres.py`.
- `make db-migrate` applies idempotent SQL revisions for existing databases (e.g. `users.name`).
- If your schema is already up to date from a recent app start, stamp Alembic once:

  ```bash
  cd backend && .venv/bin/alembic -c alembic.ini stamp head
  ```
